# CAD Run Records

- Query `scripts/run_ledger.py reuse --sample-id <id>` before drawing. Reuse a verified artifact when its source digest and task inputs remain applicable.
- Start a new run before modifying CAD. Create one attempt per materially different drawing or repair.
- Record generated scripts, DWGs, CAD logs, extracted scenes, and verifier verdicts as attempt artifacts.
- Record tool actions, failures, verifier feedback, and short decision summaries in `trajectory.jsonl`.
- Never record hidden reasoning, credentials, or unrelated conversation. Use observable actions and evidence only.
- Keep `SKILL.md` general. Put orchestration and provenance behavior in this project rule and the run-ledger tools.
- Treat run artifacts as immutable. Create a child attempt or child run instead of overwriting recorded files.
